{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-1",
      "transcript": "What if an animal could reverse its own life cycle?",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.1",
      "samples": 80400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-2",
      "transcript": "This is Turritopsis dohrnii.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 3.533333333333333,
      "duration": 2.275,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.2",
      "samples": 54600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Normally, attached polyps bud off tiny jellyfish, which grow into swimming adults.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 5.966666666666667,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.3",
      "samples": 134400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-4",
      "transcript": "But injury or starvation can send an adult another way.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 11.8,
      "duration": 4.225,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.4",
      "samples": 101400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Its bell collapses. Its tentacles disappear. It settles into a cyst-like mass.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 16.2,
      "duration": 5.75,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.5",
      "samples": 138000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Inside, cells reorganize. Some can change their specialized identity: transdifferentiation.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 22.166666666666668,
      "duration": 6.725,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.6",
      "samples": 161400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-7",
      "transcript": "A stolon grows, then polyps. That colony can bud new jellyfish.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 29.133333333333333,
      "duration": 4.775,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.7",
      "samples": 114600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Life-cycle reversal can happen repeatedly in laboratory cultures.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 34.233333333333334,
      "duration": 4.9,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.8",
      "samples": 117600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The molecular controls are still being studied.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 39.3,
      "duration": 3,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.9",
      "samples": 72000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-10",
      "transcript": "But predators can still kill it. Reversal isn't guaranteed survival.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 42.46666666666667,
      "duration": 4.625,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.10",
      "samples": 111000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-11",
      "transcript": "It doesn't make death impossible. It makes the direction of development reversible.",
      "file": "audio/jellyfish-reversal/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 47.333333333333336,
      "duration": 5.375,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "jellyfish-reversal.asset.transformation.script.11",
      "samples": 129000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
